      en: ["Average elevation ranges from 1,500 to 1,600 meters.", "Characterized by dark shale and slate rock formations.", "Located between the northern towns of Pukë and Kukës.", "Densely forested with pine and spruce trees.", "Historically significant for mineral and ore deposits.", "Provides a remote sanctuary for regional wolf populations."],
